DESCRIPTION:Are you having a bad day? Do your classes and homework have y
 ou stressed? Are you anxious about something? Do you need some unconditio
 nal love from a furry friend? Stop by the Sylvania VRC and let our Unoffi
 cial mascot\, Bob\, brighten your day. Come take a picture\, see him perf
 orm a trick\, or just pet him while he helps make your day better.—Even
 t Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382785 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?i
 d=382785)
