BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260507T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260507T120000
SUMMARY:Network Your Way Into a Job
DESCRIPTION:There's an old saying when it comes to landing a job: It's no
 t what you know\, it's who you know.There's some truth in that statement.
  A robust network is a powerful tool that can open doors to internships\,
  hidden job opportunities\, industry connections and more.Learn how to ho
 listically build\, maintain and leverage your network in this informative
  workshop hosted by Career Services – so you'll have an edge over the c
 ompetition and better chances of landing that new role!We'll cover everyt
 hing from identifying who's already in your circle and how to expand it\,
  to making the most of your connections in an authentic way.Don't miss th
 is chance to gain the confidence and skills needed to launch or change yo
 ur career.To request an accommodation\, please contact cap@pcc.edu four d
 ays before the event.Meeting Link: https://portlandcc.zoom.us/meeting/reg
 ister/7lY78p_nSci37meHANgnhQ (https://portlandcc.zoom.us/meeting/register
 /7lY78p_nSci37meHANgnhQ)—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382
 660 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382660)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:There's an old saying when it comes to landi
 ng a job: It's not what you know\, it's who you know.<br />There's some t
 ruth in that statement. A robust network is a powerful tool that can open
  doors to internships\, hidden job opportunities\, industry connections a
 nd more.<br />Learn how to holistically build\, maintain and leverage you
 r network in this informative workshop hosted by Career Services – so y
 ou'll have an edge over the competition and better chances of landing tha
 t new role!<br />We'll cover everything from identifying who's already in
  your circle and how to expand it\, to making the most of your connection
 s in an authentic way.<br />Don't miss this chance to gain the confidence
  and skills needed to launch or change your career.<br />To request an ac
 commodation\, please contact cap@pcc.edu four days before the event.<br /
 >Meeting Link: <a href="https://portlandcc.zoom.us/meeting/register/7lY78
 p_nSci37meHANgnhQ" target="_blank">https://portlandcc.zoom.us/meeting/reg
 ister/7lY78p_nSci37meHANgnhQ</a><br />—<br />Event Details: <a href="ht
 tps://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382660" target="_blank">https://hub.pcc.edu/rsv
 p?id=382660</a>
UID:20260507T180000Z-10352@events.pcc.edu
DTSTAMP:20260408T123330Z
URL:https://events.pcc.edu/event/10352-network-your-way-into-a-job
LAST-MODIFIED:20260409T000810Z
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
