DESCRIPTION:Join the PCC Learning Gardens for a container gardening and s
 mall space growing workshop that can serve up to 15 students on Wednesday
 \, May 13\, 2026 from 1:00pm until 2:45pm at the SE campus and 15 student
 s on Thursday\, May 14\, 2026 from 1:00pm until 2:45pm at the Cascade cam
 pus.—Room location will be confirmed after registration has been receiv
 ed.—The workshop will cover the intricacies of growing your vegetables 
