SUMMARY:PCC Retirement Honors
DESCRIPTION:The heart of PCC has always been its people\, and we can't wa
 it to gather once again to honor our newest retirees.  This event is a sp
 ecial opportunity for our community—staff\, faculty\, family and former
  retirees—to come together\, share stories\, and show our deep gratitud
 e for the 2025-2026 PCC retirees.  Please join us in making this a truly 
 memorable gathering on Friday\, May 15\, 2026.  4:00 PM SOCIAL TIME | Enj
 oy yummy bites and fun mocktails before the program  RETIREE RESOURCE FAI
 R | Learn from internal and external partners about resources to stay act
 ive in  retirement  5:30 PM RETIREE RECOGNITION | Join colleagues to hono
 r our 2025-2026 PCC Retirees  7:00 PM POST-RECEPTION | Connect with frien
 ds over coffee and sweets  Let us know you're coming by rsvping: https://
 forms.gle/GFfHWQJY2cP95cMV6  $15 per person\; invoice will be provided wi
 th payment details\; prepayment required  Join us for an evening of heavy
  hors d'oeuvres and fun mocktails. We won't be serving a formal dinner\, 
 so be sure to get there early to enjoy the full spread!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The heart of PCC has always been its pe
 ople\, and we can't wait to gather once again to honor our newest retiree
 s.<br />  This event is a special opportunity for our community—staff\,
  faculty\, family and former retirees—to come together\, share stories\
 , and show our deep gratitude for the 2025-2026 PCC retirees.</p><p>  Ple
 ase join us in making this a truly memorable gathering on Friday\, May 15
 \, 2026.</p><p>  4:00 PM SOCIAL TIME | Enjoy yummy bites and fun mocktail
 s before the program<br />  RETIREE RESOURCE FAIR | Learn from internal a
 nd external partners about resources to stay active in<br />  retirement<
 br />  5:30 PM RETIREE RECOGNITION | Join colleagues to honor our 2025-20
 26 PCC Retirees<br />  7:00 PM POST-RECEPTION | Connect with friends over
  coffee and sweets</p><p>  Let us know you're coming by rsvping: https://
 forms.gle/GFfHWQJY2cP95cMV6</p><p>  $15 per person\; invoice will be prov
 ided with payment details\; prepayment required</p><p>  Join us for an ev
 ening of heavy hors d'oeuvres and fun mocktails. We won't be serving a fo
 rmal dinner\, so be sure to get there early to enjoy the full spread!</p>
