BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260522T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260522T113000
SUMMARY:Intro to Autodesk Fusion
DESCRIPTION:Ever wondered how to turn a 3D idea into a physical object? J
 oin us at the Rock Creek STEAM Lab for a fun\, hands-on intro to Autodesk
  Fusion workshop! In this relaxed two-hour workshop\, you'll get a crash 
 course in 3D modeling as we "breathe life" into a digital design by model
 ing a plastic glow in the dark chair\, which also doubles as a cell phone
  holder. You'll learn the basics of parametric modeling and see how to ex
 port your chair for 3D printing. It's a great way to tinker with cutting-
 edge software\, technical 3D design\, and the basic use of a 3D printer�
 �no prior experience required! Come explore what you can build and discov
 er how these skills can lead to exciting projects in the world of CADD.�
 �Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383124 (https://hub.pcc.edu/r
 svp?id=383124)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Ever wondered how to turn a 3D idea into a p
 hysical object? Join us at the Rock Creek STEAM Lab for a fun\, hands-on 
 intro to Autodesk Fusion workshop! In this relaxed two-hour workshop\, yo
 u'll get a crash course in 3D modeling as we "breathe life" into a digita
 l design by modeling a plastic glow in the dark chair\, which also double
 s as a cell phone holder. You'll learn the basics of parametric modeling 
 and see how to export your chair for 3D printing. It's a great way to tin
 ker with cutting-edge software\, technical 3D design\, and the basic use 
 of a 3D printer—no prior experience required! Come explore what you can
  build and discover how these skills can lead to exciting projects in the
  world of CADD.<br />—<br />Event Details: <a href="https://hub.pcc.edu
 /rsvp?id=383124" target="_blank">https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383124</a>
UID:20260522T163000Z-10870@events.pcc.edu
DTSTAMP:20260506T061609Z
URL:https://events.pcc.edu/event/10870-intro-to-autodesk-fusion
LAST-MODIFIED:20260506T131609Z
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:10870
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/Los_Angeles
END:VEVENT
