BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260609T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260609T200000
SUMMARY:In Waves and War Documentary Screening
DESCRIPTION:A screening of *In Waves and War* offers an opportunity to ex
 plore the powerful stories of veterans navigating the lasting impacts of 
 military service. This documentary examines themes of trauma\, healing\, 
 and resilience\, often highlighting innovative therapies and personal jou
 rneys toward recovery. The event will include a facilitated discussion by
  the Returning Veterans Project (RVP) with a Behavioral Health Profession
 al Q&amp\;Q \, creating space for reflection\, dialogue\, and a deeper un
 derstanding of the veteran experience.—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.e
 du/rsvp?id=383026 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383026)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:A screening of *In Waves and War* offers an 
 opportunity to explore the powerful stories of veterans navigating the la
 sting impacts of military service. This documentary examines themes of tr
 auma\, healing\, and resilience\, often highlighting innovative therapies
  and personal journeys toward recovery. The event will include a facilita
 ted discussion by the Returning Veterans Project (RVP) with a Behavioral 
 Health Professional Q&amp\;Q \, creating space for reflection\, dialogue\
 , and a deeper understanding of the veteran experience.<br />—<br />Eve
 nt Details: <a href="https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383026" target="_blank">
 https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383026</a>
