BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T140000
SUMMARY:PCC QRCs at Portland Pride Parade
DESCRIPTION:Join the QRCs to participate in the Portland Pride Parade. De
 corate our shuttle\, step off into the parade\, and sing along with our p
 ride playlist!The Queer Resource Centers at PCC are excited to participat
 e in the annual Portland Pride Parade on July 19\, 2026. We want you to j
 oin us in the parade! Below is a tentative schedule for the day of the pa
 rade. A confirmation email with the final schedule will be sent out in ad
 vance. Please note that the route will take approximately 30 minutes to m
 arch\, at a leisurely pace. The parade is approximately one mile in lengt
 h and takes place on city streets.Marchers will receive a free PCC Pride 
 shirt (as supplies last)\, snacks\, water\, and so many high-fives!We don
 't yet know our meet up location\, placement number\, or estimated "step 
 off" time. We will hear from Pride NW the 1st or 2nd week of June and we 
 will email you as soon we know. Below is the preliminary schedule (SUBJEC
 T TO CHANGE):10:45-11:45am: Check in for PCC Marchers (Location TBA)10:45
 am: Begin decorating the PCC Shuttle &amp\; sign making11am: Parade offic
 ially begins (our contingent won't start marching until later!)TBA: Group
  Picture12:30pm (or so): Estimated marching start time1:30/2pm: Estimated
  finish time*Note: We encourage people to wear their shirt from prior PCC
  Pride contingency if available.—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsv
 p?id=382666 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382666)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Join the QRCs to participate in the Portland
  Pride Parade. Decorate our shuttle\, step off into the parade\, and sing
  along with our pride playlist!<br />The Queer Resource Centers at PCC ar
 e excited to participate in the annual Portland Pride Parade on July 19\,
  2026. We want you to join us in the parade! Below is a tentative schedul
 e for the day of the parade. A confirmation email with the final schedule
  will be sent out in advance. Please note that the route will take approx
 imately 30 minutes to march\, at a leisurely pace. The parade is approxim
 ately one mile in length and takes place on city streets.<br />Marchers w
 ill receive a free PCC Pride shirt (as supplies last)\, snacks\, water\, 
 and so many high-fives!<br />We don't yet know our meet up location\, pla
 cement number\, or estimated "step off" time. We will hear from Pride NW 
 the 1st or 2nd week of June and we will email you as soon we know. Below 
 is the preliminary schedule (SUBJECT TO CHANGE):<br />10:45-11:45am: Chec
 k in for PCC Marchers (Location TBA)<br />10:45am: Begin decorating the P
 CC Shuttle &amp\; sign making<br />11am: Parade officially begins (our co
 ntingent won't start marching until later!)<br />TBA: Group Picture<br />
 12:30pm (or so): Estimated marching start time<br />1:30/2pm: Estimated f
 inish time<br />*Note: We encourage people to wear their shirt from prior
  PCC Pride contingency if available.<br />—<br />Event Details: <a href
 ="https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382666" target="_blank">https://hub.pcc.edu
 /rsvp?id=382666</a>
